          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela kuseliwe Mlawi uko mzinyi kwako; kwa kukaia uo ndewadie ifungu hata ifwa jingi chiaimweri na oho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutua kwa kula miaka idadu, kurede mzinyi kwako ifungu jako ja ikumi ja ugho mwaka na kujiwika nganyenyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlawi, angu uo usewadie ifungu hata ifwa jingi chiaimweri na oho, na waghenyi wemara-mara, na wana wisewadie weke ndee, na waka wakiwa awo wiko mizinyi konyu wichacha wije na kughuda; eri BWANA Mlungu wako upate kukurasimia kwa kazi rako rose kuribonyagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
